            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nA page whose title contains **Getting Started** must be shared with the integration (the Notion default page).\n\nThe flow searches for an existing page on purpose: Notion's search index is eventually consistent, so a page created a moment ago is not reliably found. The search is fuzzy, hence the case-insensitive title check."
